{
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The cancellation fee cannot stand under POL-NS-01. Limb (d) requires the trip to have been terminated by the driver with cancellation_reason_code RIDER_NO_SHOW, RIDER_UNREACHABLE or EXCESSIVE_WAIT; the trip record shows DRIVER_UNABLE_TO_LOCATE, which POL-NS-01 itself characterises as the driver's own admission that he could not find the rider and which it expressly routes to POL-NS-03. Once limb (d) fails, POL-NS-01 is not satisfied and the fee is not chargeable under it; the dispute must be decided under POL-NS-03 (or POL-NS-02/POL-NS-06), all of which return the fee to the rider on these facts.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-TRIP-00206"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-01", "POL-NS-03"],
      "relies_on": "trip_record.cancellation_reason_code",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "POL-NS-02 sets the arrival radius for a LARGE_VENUE pickup at 120 m. The driver's own trace never brought him closer than 284.95 m to the pin, and the derived arrival block records qualifying_fix_count 0 and a longest qualifying run of 0.0 seconds across the entire attempt. On POL-NS-02 the driver never arrived, POL-NS-01 limb (b) fails, and the rider is entitled to a full refund of the cancellation fee. DISCLOSURE: EV-GPS-00206 is IMPAIRED by the admissibility pre-pass for issue code LOW_SAMPLE_RATE (median sample interval 18 s against a nominal 10 s cadence), weight_multiplier 0.8; the finding survives the discount because it does not depend on any missing fix — every fix the trace does carry is more than twice the 120 m radius from the pin.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00206", "EV-TRIP-00206"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-02"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.qualifying_fix_count",
      "asserted_weight": 0.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Even on the assumption most favourable to the driver — that he held position somewhere — the dwell POL-NS-01(c) and POL-NS-06 measure is in-geofence dwell, and the derived arrival block puts the longest qualifying run at 0.0 seconds against the 300 second minimum for LARGE_VENUE, with qualifying_fix_count 0. POL-NS-06 therefore requires the fee to be refunded in full, expressly 'whether or not the rider was present and whether or not the rider responded to messages'. The trip record's wait_time_min of 6.6 is measured from the arrival marker, not from a qualifying in-geofence fix, and does not substitute for the missing dwell. DISCLOSURE: EV-GPS-00206 is impaired for LOW_SAMPLE_RATE at weight_multiplier 0.8; the zero-dwell finding rests on that same trace and is unaffected by the discount.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00206", "EV-TRIP-00206"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-06"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.longest_qualifying_run.duration_sec",
      "asserted_weight": 0.8
    },
    {
      "text": "POL-NS-03's distance test is met on its face: the driver's closest approach, 284.95 m, is outside the 120 m POL-NS-02 arrival radius but comfortably inside the 400 m wrong-entrance ceiling, so wherever he held position he did not arrive at the pickup point and POL-NS-01 limb (b) fails. The trip record's pickup carries venue_id VEN-VIVOCITY, but the trace carries no venue_id for the driver's position, so the venue match is not established either way and, exactly as POL-NS-03 directs, the distance test governs alone — no advocate and no judge may assert from general geography that the two points are the same venue, block or entrance. The rider's outcome is the same on either branch: POL-NS-02 refunds in full if he never held station, POL-NS-03 refunds in full if he did. DISCLOSURE: EV-GPS-00206 is impaired for LOW_SAMPLE_RATE at weight_multiplier 0.8.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00206", "EV-TRIP-00206"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-03"],
      "relies_on": "derived.driver_track.min_distance_m",
      "asserted_weight": 0.8
    },
    {
      "text": "On POL-NS-03's fault allocation, neither party named a sub-location anywhere in the chat log — it holds two SYSTEM notifications and nothing else, with no locating message from either side — and the trip record shows 4 registered pickup points at this LARGE_VENUE. POL-NS-03(ii) therefore attributes the mislocation to pin ambiguity rather than to either party, and the driver's payment is the platform-funded goodwill of 50 percent of the cancellation fee, SGD 2.00 of SGD 4.00, charged to the platform and never recovered from the rider. The rider's SGD 4.00 is refunded in full and the two figures are independent, not netted.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-CHAT-00206", "EV-TRIP-00206", "EV-FARE-00206"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-03"],
      "relies_on": "fare_breakdown.derived.money.goodwill.value",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The rider's own track confirms she was at the pin for the whole attempt: 31 fixes between 15:08:20 and 15:21:00, every one of them between 7.57 m and 22.50 m of the pickup point, with no recorded speed other than 0.0 kph. The pickup point was not ambiguous to the party standing on it, and the 284.95 m separation lies wholly on the driver's side of the encounter; POL-NS-03's attribution of the mislocation to pin ambiguity rather than to either party adds nothing against the rider who was on the pin. DISCLOSURE: EV-GPS-00206 is impaired for LOW_SAMPLE_RATE at weight_multiplier 0.8; the rider-track figures come from the same artifact and the discount does not disturb them.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00206", "EV-TRIP-00206"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-03"],
      "relies_on": "derived.rider_presence.max_distance_m",
      "asserted_weight": 0.8
    },
    {
      "text": "The ruling here is not capped at PARTIAL_REFUND and no escalation ground under POL-NS-09 is engaged. The GPS artifact's IMPAIRED tag is schema-level only for POL-NS-08 purposes: the largest sampling interval is 26 seconds, under the 120 second gap limb (b), the trace carries far more than 6 fixes and does carry the rider track, and the SGD 4.00 cancellation fee exactly equals the greater of the LARGE_VENUE zone fee (4.00) and the RYDE_X vehicle-tier fee (4.00) under the fee_schedule resolution rule, so limb (d) does not bite either. Since the deciding fact is not carried solely by an artifact impaired under POL-NS-08(a) to (d), the full refund is available on this record. DISCLOSURE: EV-GPS-00206 is impaired at weight_multiplier 0.8 for issue code LOW_SAMPLE_RATE.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00206", "EV-FARE-00206", "EV-TRIP-00206"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-08"],
      "relies_on": "fare_breakdown.derived.money.difference",
      "asserted_weight": 0.8
    },
    {
      "text": "POL-NS-07 does not apply and no fee-funded compensation is payable on this trip. The 80 percent figure (SGD 3.20 of SGD 4.00) is conditional on POL-NS-01 being satisfied in full, and here limb (b), limb (c) and limb (d) all fail. Nor does the anti-farming check trip on the only fields POL-NS-07 names: driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d is 1, below the threshold of 4, and 1 divided by driver_profile.completed_trips_30d of 187 is 0.005, far below 0.08 — so POL-NS-09(d) is not engaged either, and neither the 80 percent payment nor an escalation backlog can be built on this record. The only driver payment this trip supports is the POL-NS-03(ii) platform-funded goodwill.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-00206", "EV-DPROF-00206", "EV-TRIP-00206"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-07"],
      "relies_on": "driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The traffic advisory artifact EV-ADVIS-00206-01 is MISSING, keeps its weight of 0.0 and holds no payload; its absence is itself citable and establishes that no advisory covers the VivoCity or HarbourFront kerbs in this window. That absence cannot be converted into a licence to shorten the required dwell: POL-NS-06(i) permits in-geofence intervals to be summed only where a present and populated traffic_advisory of the listed types covers the pickup road, and POL-NS-06(ii) states that a traffic_advisory never reduces the required minimum and never excuses a shortfall on its own. The 300 second minimum for this LARGE_VENUE pickup therefore stands untouched by the missing advisory.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-ADVIS-00206-01", "EV-TRIP-00206"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-06"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.accumulated_dwell.limb.available",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    }
  ]
}

